  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "厝"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.07909179152920842\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">陳韻伃</span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></b><br />\n<ol style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\">\n<li style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13px; list-style-type: decimal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">城堡</span></b></li>\n</ol>\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ǹg望之下我出世--ah，像公主</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">恁用半世人替我起造 ê城堡</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">學爬，學行</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">就是學bē-hiáu獨立</span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></span></b><br />\n<a name='more'></a><ol start=\"2\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\">\n<li style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13px; list-style-type: decimal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">鳥籠仔</span></b></li>\n</ol>\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">鳥仔siàu想外口ê光景</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">著急beh挵出家己ê一phiàn天</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">門拍開，頭mā無uat就衝--出-去</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">無奈</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">得--著kap得bē著--ê lóng是人生ê khih角</span></b><div>\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><ol start=\"3\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\">\n<li style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13px; list-style-type: decimal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">避風港</span></li>\n</ol>\n<span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">燈火閃閃sih-sih</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">親像kā我tsit隻飛忝ê鳥仔ia̍t手</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mi̍h件無變，思念koh-khah bē變</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">雄雄</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">目睭內底ê烏暗hō͘點光--ah</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">門</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">拍開</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-indent: 203.5pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（作者是中山醫學大學台語系學生）</span></div>\n</b></div>"
  },
